BT 1 0 0 1 0 65.4 Tm /F1 9 Tf 12.4 TL (Our group's use case is a lightweight smartphone activity monitor that can label everyday movement as still, standing,) Tj T* (walking, or jumping. Recognizing these states can support personal activity logging and context-aware mobile services) Tj T* (without requiring specialized wearable equipment. A Hidden Markov Model \(HMM\) is appropriate because motion is) Tj T* (measured as a sequence: the current activity is not observed directly, and nearby time windows are likely to share the same) Tj T* (state. The project therefore tests whether features from phone accelerometer recordings can identify these four controlled) Tj T* (activities.) Tj T* ET
