BT 1 0 0 1 0 40.6 Tm /F1 9 Tf 12.4 TL -0.050758 Tw (The supplied dataset contains 79 CSV recordings organized by activity: 17 still, 20 standing, 21 walking, and 21 jumping. The) Tj T* 0 Tw (dataset summary reports approximately 559 seconds of recording in total. The sampling-rate report shows an original rate of) Tj T* (about 125 Hz. No gyroscope channels were detected in these recordings, so the implemented model uses accelerometer) Tj T* (data only.) Tj T* ET
